@startuml uc2_state
!include style.puml

' Title, arrows, and arrow labels in decision-block golden yellow;
' state box text stays in grey (#333333 / #555555 from style.puml)
skinparam titleFontColor #B8860B
skinparam ArrowColor #B8860B
skinparam ArrowFontColor #B8860B

' Extra spacing to prevent arrow/label collisions around Loading
skinparam nodesep 80
skinparam ranksep 65

title UC2 - Animation of an indicator over time (1975–2025)

state Idle
state Loading
state NoData
state Error

Loading : entry / fetch all years in one API call
NoData : no data available for this period
Error : API unavailable or invalid request

state Active {
  state Paused
  state Playing
  state Finished
  state checkEnd <<choice>>

  [*] --> Paused : currentYear = startYear,\nrecolour map

  Paused : scrub(year) / currentYear = year, recolour map
  Playing : entry / start timer
  Playing : exit / stop timer
  Finished : currentYear = endYear

  Paused -right--> Playing : play\n[currentYear < endYear]
  Playing -left--> Paused : pause
  Playing --> Paused : scrub(year) /\ncurrentYear = year,\nrecolour map
  Finished --> Paused : scrub(year) /\ncurrentYear = year,\nrecolour map

  Playing -down--> checkEnd : tick
  checkEnd --> Playing : [currentYear < endYear]\n/ currentYear++, recolour map
  checkEnd --> Finished : [currentYear == endYear]

  Finished --> Playing : replay /\ncurrentYear = startYear,\nrecolour map
}

Active : entry / compute global colour scale
Active : changeSpeed(s) / update timer interval

[*] -down-> Idle : openView
Idle -down--> Loading : selectIndicator\n(code, period)

' Layout anchors: Error (top-left), NoData (bottom-left) of Loading
Error -[hidden]right-> Idle
Error -[hidden]down-> NoData
NoData -[hidden]right-> Active

' Top-left: Error <-> Loading
Loading -up--> Error : loadFailed
Error -down--> Loading : retry or\nselectIndicator

' Bottom-left: NoData <-> Loading
Loading -down--> NoData : dataLoaded\n[empty]
NoData -up--> Loading : selectIndicator

' Right: self-loop on Loading
Loading -right-> Loading : selectIndicator /\ncancel previous request

' Center-bottom: Loading <-> Active
Loading -down--> Active : dataLoaded\n[hasData]
Active -up--> Loading : selectIndicator or\nchangePeriod

Active -down-> [*] : closeView

note right of Active
  Defaults: startYear = 1975, endYear = 2025.
  Global colour scale is fixed on entry so colours
  keep the same meaning across all frames.
  Map geometry is never reloaded; only fill colours update.
end note

@enduml